   "lines": [
    "In the morning",
    "walked half way",
    "round the lake",
    "but saw nothing;",
    "there are ^very few^ ~~few~~ partridges",
    "and ~~not a[?]~~ few",
    "ducks round here;",
    "larger game is",
    "not scarce, but",
    "almost impossible",
    "to get at. In the",
    "afternoon walked",
    "some distance down",
    "beside Sandy Brook;",
    "coming home killed",
    "a duck in Moose",
    "Pond. Trout of small",
    "size are very plentiful."
   ],
